<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19053" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūnē^bris</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		funus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a funeral</i>, <i>funeral</i>-, <i>funereal</i> (syn.:
			funerĕus, feralis; funestus, fatalis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Vatin. 12, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestimentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Leg. 2, 23, 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 114</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cupressi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 5, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pompa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 67</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 84, 341</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 153</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laudationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
				ib.</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 7, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					2, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūnē^bria</span></b> , ium,
				n., <i>funeral rites</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Leg.
				2, 24, 50</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 52, 53, §
			177</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>deadly</i>, <i>mortal</i>, <i>fatal</i>, <i>cruel</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacra,</span>”
				i. e. <i>human offerings</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 4, 4, 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 19, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 37, 84, § 209</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malum populis (elephantiasis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 26,
					1, 5, § 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">difficiles, funebria ligna, tabellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 1, 12, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
